# Keep the build context small and free of local-only state. Note the model
# weights and shade catalog are ALSO excluded: production images fetch both
# from the Hugging Face artifact repo at startup (deploy/fetch_artifacts.py),
# so local and Space builds behave identically.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.expo
**/ios
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
beautylens/beautylens.db
beautylens/.coverage
beautylens/.env
beautylens/models
beautylens/data/sources
beautylens/data/shade_catalog_seed.json
beautylens/tests/fixtures
docs
